Global Ayyappa Sangamam. Though this was an official visit; it was also a personal journey to a place where my grandfather, P.T. Rajan, rendered his service decades ago \\u2013 in the creation, consecration, installation of the revered idol of Lord Ayyappa we see today, and increasing the followership multi-fold by touring across the region with the idol.", "I thank the Hon\\u2019ble Chief Minister of Tamil Nadu Thiru mkstalin for deputing me, alongside my colleague HR & CE Minister Thiru Sekhar Babu, to represent our govt and the people of our state. I commend the Honourable Kerala CM pinarayivijayan, the Kerala Govt & the Travancore Devaswom Board for this conclave to frame the vision for a sustainable and inclusive future.", "At the heart of all religion lies the notion that one must strive to be a good person. In some way, to have a belief system is to reinforce humanity in our actions -- to let ourselves be guided by kindness, fairness and accountability to the Almighty. Celebrating the 75th anniversary of the Dewasom Board is to acknowledge the multiple attempts to democratise religion as a part of our human quest for trust, equality, transparency.", "As I visited the shrine later that evening with my son, I kept reflecting on how public servants/ elected officials like me must be steadfastly secular in the discharge of our duties and not allow fundamentalism of any sort to creep in, sometimes overriding (and at other times balancing out) our conditioned impulses which are likely to be biased towards our own faith.", "He will rebuild #TamilNadu, brick by brick, rescuing it from the clutches of evil, just like how he safeguarded aiadmk.official .\\n\\nPuratchi Thamizhar eps.tamilnadu , A leader from the roots,\\nThe leader of TN\'s Common Folk!\\n\\n#\\u0bae\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bc8\\u0b95\\u0bcd_\\u0b95\\u0bbe\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bcb\\u0bae\\u0bcd\\n#\\u0ba4\\u0bae\\u0bbf\\u0bb4\\u0b95\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bc8_\\u0bae\\u0bc0\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b