c1 \\u0baa\\u0bcb\\u0b95 \\u201c\\u0baa\\u0bb8\\u0bcd-\\u0baa\\u0bbe\\u0bb8\\u0bcd\\u201d \\u0b87\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1, \\u0b86\\u0ba9\\u0bbe \\u0baa\\u0bb8\\u0bcd \\u0b87\\u0bb2\\u0bcd\\u0bb2! \\u0b95\\u0ba9\\u0bb5\\u0bc8 \\u0b9a\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0bb5\\u0baf\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bb2\\u0bcd, \\u0b85\\u0b9a\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bcb\\u0b9f\\u0bc1 \\u0baa\\u0bb3\\u0bcd\\u0bb3\\u0bbf\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1 \\u0baa\\u0baf\\u0ba3\\u0bbf\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0bae\\u0bbe\\u0ba3\\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bcd.", "\\u0b95\\u0bc2\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0ba3\\u0bbf \\u0b95\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0bbf\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bc8 \\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0bb4\\u0bc1\\u0b99\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bae\\u0bc1\\u0b95!", "Dear PriyankaGandhi, MamataOfficial, supriya_sule, RahulGandhi, yadavakhilesh, yadavtejashwi, HemantSorenJMM, ArvindKejriwal, Sonia Gandhi, Brinda Karat,\\n\\nDo you endorse the statement made by DMK Minister trbrajaa that women in North India are not considered as humans?", "His remark is not just an insult to women of North India, it is an affront to the very spirit of Nari shakthi that has shaped our nation. It is deeply unfortunate that a minister from your alliance chooses to ignore the legacy of courageous women rulers, freedom fighters, social reformers, political leaders, teachers and entrepreneurs across India whose contributions shaped our nation\\u2019s history, development progress.", "Your silence speaks volumes. Is alliance politics more important than standing up for the dignity of our women? Or does this silence reflect the INDI alliance\\u2019s belief system and its poor track record in ensuring women\\u2019s safety and empowerment?\\n\\nWe BJP4TamilNadu stand unwaveringly for the rights and dignity of women across India, no matter North, South, East and West. If the INDI Alliance truly respects women, it must immediately denoun