2026-01-28 17:23:27,665 [DEBUG] voyage - data='{"input": ["Met officials of the Paralympic Committee of India and presented medals to the winners of the Women\\u2019s Discus Throw event at the World Para Athletics Championships, New Delhi 2025.\\n\\nCongratulations to the medalists and PCI for the successful and inspiring championship! \\ud83c\\uddee\\ud83c\\uddf3\\ud83c\\udfc5\\n#ParaAthletics", "Glad to present the Silver Medal to Madina Mukhtirova (Uzbekistan) for her stellar performance in the Women\\u2019s Discus Throw at the World Para Athletics Championships, New Delhi 2025.\\nA true symbol of determination and grit! \\n\\nPCI_IN_Official\\n\\n#ParaAthletics #KheloIndia #Inspiration", "\\ud83e\\udd47 Gold \\u2013 Lara Baars (Netherlands)\\nDelighted to present the Gold Medal to Lara Baars from the Netherlands for her exceptional performance in the Women\\u2019s Discus Throw event at the World Para Athletics Championships, New Delhi 2025.\\nHer determination is truly inspiring! \\ud83d\\udcaa\\u2728\\n\\nPCI_IN_Official\\n#ParaAthletics #KheloIndia", "\\u0b95\\u0ba4\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0b95\\u0bc8\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bb1\\u0bbf\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0b95\\u0bc8 \\u0b95\\u0bca\\u0b9f\\u0bc1\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bcb\\u0bae\\u0bcd! \\n\\u0ba8\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0ba8\\u0bc6\\u0b9a\\u0bb5\\u0bbe\\u0bb3\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1 \\u0b86\\u0ba4\\u0bb0\\u0bb5\\u0bc1 \\u0b95\\u0bca\\u0b9f\\u0bc1\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bcb\\u0bae\\u0bcd! \\n\\nIn every piece of khadi and handloom lives the spirit of our weavers.\\nLet\\u2019s celebrate and support them! \\ud83c\\uddee\\ud83c\\uddf3 \\n\\n#VocalforLocal #AtmanirbharBharat\\n#Khadi #Handloom #MakeInIndia", "\\u0bae\\u0ba9\\u0b9a\\u0bbe\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0bbf \\u0b87\\u0bb2\\u0bcd\\u0bb2\\u0bbe\\u0ba4\\u0bb5\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bcd \\u0ba4\\u0bbe\\u0ba9\\u0bcd \\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bae\\u0bc1\\u0b95 \\u0bb5\