\\u0bb4\\u0bcd\\u0ba8\\u0bbe\\u0b9f\\u0bc1 \\u0b89\\u0bb3\\u0bcd\\u0bb3\\u0bae\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0bb5\\u0bb0\\u0bb2\\u0bbe\\u0bb1\\u0bcd\\u0bb1\\u0bbf\\u0bb2\\u0bcd \\u0ba8\\u0bc0\\u0b99\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bbe\\u0ba4\\u0bc1 \\u0ba8\\u0bbf\\u0bb2\\u0bc8\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd.", "Major new initiatives from SIPCOT launched by Honourable Chief Minister of Tamil Nadu Thiru. MK Stalin avargal today !", "In a pioneering move, a first-of-its-kind in India, SIPCOT has partnered with FICCI FLO to establish high-quality early childhood care and education centres within our industrial parks. This initiative aims to support the children of thousands of working women employed in these parks.The project will commence with 16 centres across 16 industrial parks, enhancing work-life balance for women and promoting a supportive environment for families.", "Further, the momentum continues on investment front too, with inauguration of two new Mega Food Parks in Theni and Tindivanam. These parks will host over 20 food processing units, attracting investments worth hundreds of crores and creating more than 1,000 jobs. The focus will be on key sectors such as millets, fisheries, and edible oil, further strengthening Tamil Nadu\\u2019s position as a hub for industrial and agricultural innovation.\\n\\n#InvestInTN #BullishOnTN #JobsForTN #DravidianModel", "\\u2728LARGEST EVER #engineering #JobsForTN commitment for Tamil Nadu ! \\n\\n#Foxconn commits Rs. 15,000 CRORE in investments and 14,000 JOBS high value jobs ! Engineers get ready !\\n\\nTamil Nadu\\u2019s investment promotion agency Guidance Tamil Nadu will be the \\u201cfirst in India\\u201d to have a dedicated #FoxconnDesk !", "Yet another major boost for Tamil Nadu\\u2019s electronics and advanced manufacturing sector as Honourable Chief Minister of Tamil Nadu Thiru. MK Stalin avargal met with Foxconn\\u2019s India Representative Mr. Robert Wu to reaffirm their deep trust in Tamil Nadu with substantial investment commitments. \\n\\nFoxconn will bring its next phase of value-added manufacturing, R&D integration and AI-led advanced tech operations to Tamil Nadu."], "model": "voyage-multilingual-2", "input_type": "document", "truncation": true, "output_dtype": "float", "output_dimension": 1024, "encoding_format": "base64"}' message='Post details'
