2026-01-28 17:29:45,289 [DEBUG] voyage - data='{"input": ["#", "\\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0bc1\\u0ba8\\u0b95\\u0bb0\\u0bbf\\u0bb2\\u0bcd \\u0b89\\u0bb3\\u0bcd\\u0bb3 \\u0bae\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0baf \\u0b9a\\u0bc7\\u0bae\\u0bbf\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd \\u0b95\\u0bbf\\u0b9f\\u0b99\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1 \\u0ba8\\u0bbf\\u0bb1\\u0bc1\\u0bb5\\u0ba9\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bc8 \\u0ba8\\u0bc7\\u0bb0\\u0bbf\\u0bb2\\u0bcd \\u0b9a\\u0bc6\\u0ba9\\u0bcd\\u0bb1\\u0bc1 \\u0b86\\u0baf\\u0bcd\\u0bb5\\u0bc1 \\u0ba8\\u0b9f\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0ba9\\u0bc7\\u0ba9\\u0bcd.\\n\\n#virudhunagar #centralwarehouse #inspectionvisit #warehousemanagement #ManickamTagore", "#CoimbatoreGangRape: Criminals Must be Severely Punished!\\n\\nThe brutal gang-rape of a college student near Coimbatore Airport has sent shockwaves across Tamil Nadu and sparked widespread outrage. According to reports, the victim was abducted and assaulted by three men late on the night of November 2, 2025, while speaking with her friend near the airport.", "This horrifying crime once again exposes the alarming decline in women\\u2019s safety under the current administration. Since the DMK came to power, Tamil Nadu has witnessed an unrelenting surge in crimes \\u2014 including sexual assaults, murders, violent attacks, robberies, and the rampant abuse of liquor, ganja, and narcotics, which have turned public spaces unsafe for ordinary citizens.", "Crimes against women, in particular, have reached an unbearable level. From schoolgirls to elderly women, victims are facing unimaginable trauma on a daily basis. The government\\u2019s repeated failure to take decisive action, even after several shocking incidents such as the Anna University student assault case, has led to yet another tragic episode in Coimbatore.", "It is impossible to curb crime without eradicating the unchecked flow of alcohol and drugs. A government that profits from selling liquor cannot credibly claim to protect its people. Instead of upholding law and order, the police force has been reduced to serving the interests of the ruling party, silencing opposition leaders, journalists, and social activists, while neglecting its foremost duty: protecting citizens, especially women.", "How many more women must suffer before the government wakes up to this reality? Is this the \\u201cDravidian Model\\u201d that claims to safeguard and empower women?\\n\\nI strongly urge that the culprits behind the Coimbatore Airport gang rape be brought to justice with the severest punishment under the law . The government must act decisively, not with words, but with action, to restore safety, dignity, and justice for the women of Tamil Nadu.\\n\\n- #Seeman | Chief Coordinator | #NTK", "- #Seeman | Chief Coordinator | #NTK \\n\\n#EndRapeCulture | #SafetyForWomen\\n#StopViolenceAgainstWomen | #TamilNadu\\n#AccountabilityNow | #WomenDeserveSafety\\n#LawAndOrder", "\\u0b95\\u0ba9\\u0bbf\\u0bae \\u0bb5\\u0bb3\\u0b99\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bc8\\u0baf\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd, \\u0b95\\u0bbf\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0ba9\\u0bbf\\u0baf\\u0bc8\\u0baf\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bae\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0ba9\\u0bb0\\u0bcd \\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0b9f\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bbf\\u0bb1\\u0bbe\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bcd - \\u0ba8\\u0bae\\u0ba4\\u0bc1 \\u0ba4\\u0bb2\\u0bc8\\u0bb5\\u0bb0\\u0bcd \\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0bc1.NainarBJP \\u0b85\\u0bb5\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bcd!\\n\\n#\\u0ba4\\u0bae\\u0bbf\\u0bb4\\u0b95\\u0bae\\u0bcd_\\u0ba4\\u0bb2\\u0bc8\\u0ba8\\u0bbf\\u0bae\\u0bbf\\u0bb0_\\u0ba4\\u0bae\\u0bbf\\u0bb4\\u0ba9\\u0bbf\\u0ba9\\u0bcd_\\u0baa\\u0baf\\u0ba3\\u0bae\\u0bcd", "\\u0ba8\\u0bbe\\u0bae\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb2\\u0bcd \\u0bb0\\u0baf\\u0bbf\\u0bb2\\u0bcd \\u0ba8\\u0bbf\\u0bb2\\u0bc8\\u0baf\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bb1\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1 \\u0bb0\\u0bc2.9.4 \\u0b95\\u0bcb\\u0b9f\\u0bbf\\u0baf\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd, \\u0ba8\\u0bbe\\u0bae\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0