\u0bc7\\u0ba9\\u0bcd.", "The 56th International Film Festival of India (IFFI) returns to the vibrant shores of Goa from November 20 to 28, 2025, bringing together filmmakers, storytellers, and visionaries from around the world. \\nThis year, #IFFI embraces the future with India\\u2019s first-ever AI Film Festival and Hackathon, celebrating the fusion of art, innovation, and technology that is redefining the landscape of global cinema.\\n\\n#IFFI2025 #IFFI56", "Honored to join the mass singing of Vande Mataram at Parliament House today along with Secretary (Parliamentary Affairs) Shri Nikunj Bihari Dhal ji and other senior officials from the Ministry of Parliamentary Affairs. As today marks Vande Mataram\\u2019s 150th commemoration, we paid our tributes to our nation\\u2019s cultural heritage.\\n\\n#VandeMataram150", "Hon\\u2019ble Prime Minister Shri narendramodi ji released a Commemorative Stamp and a Coin to mark the 150th anniversary of our National Song \\u2018Vande Mataram\\u2019 \\u2014 a timeless ode that continues to awaken the spirit of patriotism, unity, and devotion to our Motherland \\u2013 Maa Bharati.\\n\\n#VandeMataram150 | #VandeMataramAt150", "Our Hon\\u2019ble PM Shri. narendramodi ji launched a dedicated portal to commemorate the 150th anniversary of our National Song \\u2018Vande Mataram\\u2019 - the very symbol of national pride, patriotism, and unity. \\n\\n#VandeMataram150 | #VandeMataramAt150", "150 years ago, \\u201cVande Mataram\\u201d lit a spark that united India in its fight for freedom. Today, in a confident and resurgent New India, that spark has become a national fire powering progress, innovation, and global leadership.\\n#VandeMataram150"], "model": "voyage-multilingual-2", "input_type": "document", "truncation": true, "output_dtype": "float", "output_dimension": 1024, "encoding_format": "base64"}' message='Post details'
