, Thiru. Dirk Panter. \\n\\nOur discussions focused on expanding Tamil Nadu\\u2013Saxony cooperation in key sectors like R&D, automotive, semiconductors and textiles.", "Especially thrilled that we explored collaborations in Technical Textiles, connecting Saxony\\u2019s advanced textile machinery manufacturers with Tamil Nadu\\u2019s vibrant textile ecosystem for automation, quality upgrades, and joint R&D on technical fibres and composites. \\n\\nWe had earlier visited Saxony\\u2019s trade office in Germany to identify collaborative opportunities, and an MoU between Tamil Nadu and Saxony is now being finalised to deepen this partnership, especially in the skilled manpower supply area."], "model": "voyage-multilingual-2", "input_type": "document", "truncation": true, "output_dtype": "float", "output_dimension": 1024, "encoding_format": "base64"}' message='Post details'
