. \\n\\nUnder the leadership of the Hon\\u2019ble PM Shri narendramodi ji, Bharat continues to strengthen its position as a global content hub, fostering partnerships that inspire creativity and innovation.", "Attended the Creative Minds of Tomorrow event #CMOT on day 2 of the 56th edition of IFFI in Goa.", "Joined by Secretary of I&B Shri Sanjay Jaju ji, JS Films (MoIB) Shri Ajay Nagabhushan ji, MD NFDC Shri Prakash Magdum ji, CEO Shorts TV, Mr Carter Pilcher, and Chaiperson Great Grand Jury Shri Dharmendra Sharma ji, Creative Minds of Tomorrow (CMOT), now in its 5th instalment, has firmly established itself as one of India\\u2019s most important platforms for discovering and shaping new filmmaking talent. Events like CMOT are truly paving the way for budding talent in India!", "The Opening Film #TheBlueTrail was screened at #IFFI56. Directed by Brazil\\u2019s visionary filmmaker Gabriel Mascaro, The Blue Trail tells a compelling story of defiance and one woman\\u2019s final wish \\u2014 an inspiring beginning to this year\\u2019s film festival.\\n\\nWas joined by the Hon\\u2019ble Chief Minister of Goa Shri. drpramodpsawant ji; Shri Sanjay Jaju ji, Secretary, Ministry of Information & Broadcasting; Festival Director Shri. shekharkapur ji; and the legendary Padma Bhushan actor Shri Nandamuri Balakrishna ji.", "#IFFI56 #IFFI2025", "\\u0b8e\\u0ba9\\u0bcd \\u0b89\\u0baf\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0bbf\\u0ba9\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0bae\\u0bc7\\u0bb2\\u0bbe\\u0ba9 \\u0b85\\u0ba9\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bc1 \\u0b95\\u0bb4\\u0b95 \\u0b89\\u0b9f\\u0ba9\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bbf\\u0bb1\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bc7 \\u0ba8\\u0b9f\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95 \\u0b87\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0bae\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bcd \\u0b89\\u0bb0\\u0bbf\\u0bae\\u0bc8 \\u0bae\\u0bc0\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bc1 \\u0bae\\u0bbe\\u0ba8\\u0bbe\\u0b9f\\u0bc1 2.O \\u0b95\\u0b9f\\u0bb2\\u0bc2\\u0bb0\\u0bcd \\u0bae\\u0bbe\\u0bb5\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bae\\u0bc