d \\u0ba8\\u0bc7\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0bae\\u0bc8\\u0baf\\u0bbe\\u0ba9 \\u0baa\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bb2\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1 \\u0ba4\\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0baf\\u0bbe\\u0ba9\\u0bb5\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bcd - \\u0b85\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0b95\\u0bbe\\u0bb0\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bc1\\u0bb5 \\u0b8f\\u0bae\\u0bbe\\u0bb1\\u0bcd\\u0bb1\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0bb2\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1 \\u0b85\\u0bb2\\u0bcd\\u0bb2.\\n\\u0b92\\u0bb5\\u0bcd\\u0bb5\\u0bca\\u0bb0\\u0bc1 \\u0bae\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0baf\\u0baa\\u0bcd \\u0baa\\u0bb3\\u0bcd\\u0bb3\\u0bbf\\u0baf\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0ba4\\u0ba3\\u0bbf\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc8 \\u0b9a\\u0bc6\\u0baf\\u0bcd\\u0baf\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bc1, \\u0bae\\u0bc7\\u0bae\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0b9f\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bc1, \\u0baa\\u0bbe\\u0ba4\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bbe\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bbe\\u0ba9\\u0ba4\\u0bbe\\u0b95 \\u0bae\\u0bbe\\u0bb1\\u0bcd\\u0bb1\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0b9f\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0bb5\\u0bb0\\u0bc8 \\u0b87\\u0ba4\\u0bc8 \\u0ba8\\u0bbe\\u0b99\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bcd \\u0ba4\\u0bca\\u0b9f\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0ba8\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bc1 \\u0b87\\u0ba8\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0b95\\u0bcd \\u0b95\\u0bc7\\u0bb3\\u0bcd\\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0baf\\u0bc8 \\u0b8e\\u0bb4\\u0bc1\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bbf\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bca\\u0ba3\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bc7 \\u0b87\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bcb\\u0bae\\u0bcd.\\n\\n#WinterSession", "Congress Parliamentary Party chairperson Sonia Gandhi arrives at the Parliament premises as the Winter Session begins today.\\n#WinterSession #SoniaGandhi #parliamentsession2025 #ManickamTagore", "I raised a question in Lok Sabha on a basic issue:\\n\\ud83d\\udc49\\ud83c\\udffcCan citizens speak to PSU bank staff in their own language?\\n\\ud83d\\udc49\\ud83c\\udffcAre branches staffed with people who know the local language?\\n\\nThe Government\\u2019s reply was disappointing.\\n\\nThey simply said: \\u201cBanks conduct a Local Language Test at recruitment.\\u201d\\nThat may look good on paper \\u2014\\nbut on the ground, customers in Tamil Nadu, Kerala, Maharashtra, Karnataka, Telangana, Gujarat still struggle every day.", "Language sensitivity is not a Multiple Choice Test.\\nIt is about respect, empathy and dignity.\\nFarmers, senior citizens, MSMEs \\u2014 all deserve services in their mother tongue.\\n\\nPSBs are forced to implement digital banking, Aadhaar linking, KYC rules and mergers.\\nWhen it comes to customer language rights, suddenly they are \\u201cboard governed entities\\u201d.\\nWhy this double standard?", "India has 22 official languages.\\nBanking is a public service, not a favour.\\nThe Union Government must set measurable standards:\\n\\u2714\\ufe0f Local staffing norms\\n\\u2714\\ufe0f Mandatory language training\\n\\u2714\\ufe0f Branch-level accountability\\n\\u2714\\ufe0f Time-bound grievance redressal", "We will continue to press for this.\\nBanks must speak the language of the people \\u2014 not just the language of\\nGovernment tells citizens to \\u201cGo Digital\\u201d, \\u201cUse UPI\\u201d, \\u201cLink Aadhaar\\u201d, \\u201cDo everything online.\\u201d\\nBut when people go to bank branches and speak in their own language, suddenly the Government disappears.", "#WATCH | #ParliamentWinterSession | Delhi: On PM Narendra Modi\'s \'drama\' remark against the opposition, Congress MP Manickam Tagore says, \\"It is very unfortunate that the Prime Minister is saying that the 240 MPs in parliament are doing drama. We are raising a very important issue, Prime Minister. They are taking away the votes of Dalits, minorities, and the backward class. People\'s votes have been deleted. We are asking for a discussion on it. Parliament is for what? It is not a cheerleader\'s club. It is a", "for what? It is not a cheerleader\'s club. It is a place where we discuss the people\'s issues. The right to vote has been taken out. We want a discussion on that. We are not making any drama. We want a discussion in the Parliament. He is not in the Lok Sabha today. But we were there. We want a discussion. We will also continue to ask for a discussion...\\"", "#adjourmentmotion #ParliamentSession #WinterSession #sir #ModiGovernment #IndianDemocracy  #LokSabha #ManickamTagore", "#StopSIR #JusticeForBLOs #ElectionRollsFairness #ProtectPollingStaff #ElectionCommissionAccountability #NoToForcedSIR #sir\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bae\\u0bcd #WinterSession #LokSabha #adjournmentmotion #ManickamTagore", "INDIA bloc meeting as the Parliament\\u2019s Winter Session commences today, Lok Sabha Leader of Opposition Rahul Gandhi ji, Congress president Mallikarjun Kharge ji, and other leaders are present in the meeting.\\n\\n#RahulGandhiji #WinterSession #MallikarjunKharge #LokSabha  #INDIABloc", "Congress Parliamentary Party chairperson Sonia Gandhi arrives at the Parliament premises as the Winter Session begins today.\\n\\n#WinterSession #SoniaGandhi #parliamentsession2025 #ManickamTagore", "#parliamentsession2025 #WinterSession #INDIAAlliance #SIR #ElectionCommission #IndiaDemocracy #delhi #soniyagandhiji #malikaarjunkharge #AICC #ManickamTagore", "\\u0bae\\u0bbe\\u0bb1\\u0bcd\\u0bb1\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bc8 \\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0bae\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bbf\\u0ba9\\u0bcd \\u0bae\\u0bbe\\u0ba8\\u0bbe\\u0b9f\\u0bc1 !", "\\u0baa\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0ba9\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bbf\\u0bb4\\u0bae\\u0bc8 (03-12-2025 )\\u0b9a\\u0ba8\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bcb\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\n\\nthanthitv", "\\u0b9a\\u0bc6\\u0b99\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bcb\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bc8\\u0baf\\u0ba9\\u0bc8 \\u0bb5\\u0bc6\\u0bb3\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bc1 \\u0bb5\\u0bbe\\u0b99\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bbf\\u0baf \\u0b8e\\u0b9f\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bbe\\u0b9f\\u0bbf | \\u0baa\\u0bbe\\u0ba3\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bbf\\u0b9a\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\