dRw/viewform?usp=header", "unwomenindia #unwomenindia", "\\u0b9c\\u0ba9\\u0ba8\\u0bbe\\u0baf\\u0b95 \\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0bcb\\u0ba4 SIR \\u0ba8\\u0bbf\\u0bb1\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bbf \\u0bb5\\u0bc8\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95 \\u0bb5\\u0bc7\\u0ba3\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd.\\n\\n#congressinparliament", "INDIA wins.\\nArrogance finally bows to the unity of 240 &100 MPs.\\nDiscussion on Electoral Reforms scheduled for Dec 9.\\n\\nOne full Monsoon Session was washed away because of this.\\nTwo days of the Winter Session already wasted.\\nDemocracy is not a playground for diversion \\u2014 it demands accountability.\\n\\n#WinterSession2025", "#sir #VoteChori #parliament #KirenRijiju #lokshabha #OppositionParty #ParliamentWinterSession #ManickamTagore", "VIDEO | Delhi: Congress MP Manickam Tagore\\u2019s on the Sanchar Sathi app says, \\u201cWe all know that the government always brings such measures. Strong surveillance, on whom? On every woman, every daughter of this country. Why this thirst for information? Why this kind of cheapness? Across the world, there are countries facing financial and cyber frauds, but has anyone used this kind of methodology? No. This can only happen in places like North Korea where there is dictatorship. India is not a dictatorship. We", "is dictatorship. India is not a dictatorship. We will protest. India will not accept such measures.\\u201d", "#WATCH | #ParliamentWinterSession | Delhi: Congress MP Manickam Tagore says, \\"The INDIA Alliance decided yesterday morning that we will stress for the discussion on SIR and the election electoral reform related things. Today, at 10.30 am, we are having a demonstration in front of the Makar Dwar demanding the same thing. All the MPs are going to protest outside the parliament... I had given agenda motions also, and we hope that they are accepted. We want a debate on that subject... The government should not", "on that subject... The government should not run away from this important issue because the right to vote is at stake. In Bihar, 62 lakh voters have been removed. Now it has been rolled out in 12 states... A lot of BLOs are committing suicide... We wanted to protect the democracy of India. And for that, we need a debate in the Parliament...\\"", "\\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0b9c\\u0baf\\u0bcd \\u0b95\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0bbf\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1 \\u0baa\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0bc1\\u0b9a\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0bc7\\u0bb0\\u0bbf\\u0baf\\u0bbf\\u0bb2\\u0bcd \\u0ba4\\u0b9f\\u0bc8 | \\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bae\\u0bc1\\u0b95 \\u0b8e\\u0b99\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1 \\u0b8e\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bb0 \\u0b85\\u0bb2\\u0bcd\\u0bb2 | \\u0b86\\u0ba4\\u0bb5\\u0bcd \\u0b95\\u0bca\\u0b9f\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4 \\u0bb5\\u0bbe\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bc2\\u0bb2\\u0bae\\u0bcd | \\nhttps://youtu.be/FJCttWYu0is"], "model": "voyage-multilingual-2", "input_type": "document", "truncation": true, "output_dtype": "float", "output_dimension": 1024, "encoding_format": "base64"}' message='Post details'
