2026-01-28 17:39:30,940 [DEBUG] voyage - data='{"input": ["\\u0bae\\u0ba4\\u0bc1\\u0bb0\\u0bc8 \\u0bae\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0bb2\\u0bc0\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bbe\\u0bb3\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bcd \\u0bae\\u0bbe\\u0ba8\\u0bbe\\u0b9f\\u0bc1-2025!\\n\\n91 \\u0baa\\u0bc1\\u0bb0\\u0bbf\\u0ba8\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bc1\\u0ba3\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0bb5\\u0bc1 \\u0b92\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0ba8\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0b99\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bcd \\n\\n\\u0bb0\\u0bc2.36,660.35 \\u0b95\\u0bcb\\u0b9f\\u0bbf \\u0bae\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0bb2\\u0bc0\\u0b9f\\u0bc1 \\n\\n56,766 \\u0ba8\\u0baa\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1 \\u0bb5\\u0bc7\\u0bb2\\u0bc8\\u0bb5\\u0bbe\\u0baf\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bc1\\n\\n #CMStalinInMadurai \\n#TNRising", "\\u0b8e\\u0b99\\u0bcd\\u00ad\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bcd \\u0b95\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u00ad\\u0baa\\u0bc1\\u2013\\u00ad\\u0b9a\\u0bbf\\u00ad\\u0bb5\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bc1 \\u0b95\\u0bca\\u0b9f\\u0bbf \\u0b87\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u00ad\\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u00ad\\u0bb5\\u0bb0\\u0bc8, \\u0b89\\u0b99\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bbf\\u0ba9\\u0bcd \\u0b95\\u0bb2\\u0bb5\\u0bb0 \\u0b8e\\u0ba3\\u0bcd\\u0ba3\\u0b99\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bcd \\u0b87\\u0b99\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc7 \\u0baa\\u0bb2\\u0bbf\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bbe\\u0ba4\\u0bc1!\\n\\n#DMK4TN", "Tamil Nadu isn\\u2019t just participating in India\\u2019s growth, we are powering it!\\n\\nUnder the visionary leadership of Hon\'ble CMOTamilnadu Thiru. mkstalin, #TamilNadu has become the economic engine of the nation.\\n\\nWhile others divide, Tamil Nadu unites and builds. While others provoke, Tamil Nadu governs with dignity and data.\\n\\n#DMK4TN", "Murky Air, Murky Governance!\\n\\nIndia\\u2019s #aviation crisis is not an accident, it is the direct result of BJP\\u2019s reckless #privatisation, regulatory capture, and enabling of corporate monopolies.\\n\\nThey sold our national carrier #AirIndia for scraps, killed competition, and today the entire country is held hostage by a near duopoly that decides our ticket prices and #travel fate.", "1. Airfares are at an all time high\\n2. Passengers have no choice, no rights\\n3. 43% of domestic traffic is controlled by one airline\\n4. #DGCA bends to corporate pressure, not passenger safety\\n\\n#India deserves safe, affordable, fair aviation, not corporate greed protected by Union Govt\\u2019s silence.\\n\\n#BJPFails", "\\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0bb1\\u0bb3\\u0bcd \\u0b8e\\u0ba3\\u0bcd: 134\\n\\n\\u0b95\\u0bb2\\u0bc8\\u0b9e\\u0bb0\\u0bcd \\u0b89\\u0bb0\\u0bc8: \\n\\n\\u0baa\\u0bbe\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0ba9\\u0ba9\\u0bcd \\u0b92\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0bb5\\u0ba9\\u0bcd \\u0b95\\u0bb1\\u0bcd\\u0bb1\\u0ba4\\u0bc8 \\u0bae\\u0bb1\\u0ba8\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bc1\\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bbe\\u0bb2\\u0bcd \\u0bae\\u0bc0\\u0ba3\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0baa\\u0b9f\\u0bbf\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd \\u0b95\\u0bca\\u0bb3\\u0bcd\\u0bb3 \\u0bae\\u0bc1\\u0b9f\\u0bbf\\u0baf\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd; \\u0b86\\u0ba9\\u0bbe\\u0bb2\\u0bcd, \\u0baa\\u0bbf\\u0bb1\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0b9a\\u0bcd \\u0b9a\\u0bbf\\u0bb1\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bc1 \\u0b9a\\u0bc7\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0b92\\u0bb4\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bb2\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0ba8\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bc1 \\u0b85\\u0bb5\\u0ba9\\u0bcd \\u0ba4\\u0bb5\\u0bb1\\u0bbf\\u0ba9\\u0bbe\\u0bb2\\u0bcd \\u0b87\\u0bb4\\u0bbf\\u0bae\\u0b95\\u0ba9\\u0bc7 \\u0b86\\u0bb5\\u0bbe\\u0ba9\\u0bcd.\\n\\n#\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0bb1\\u0bb3\\u0bcd", "#Madurai stood tall today ! \\n\\nHonourable Chief Minister of Tamil Nadu Thiru. MK Stalin avargal presided over the #TNRisingMadurai conclave, where we signed 91 investment MoUs, bringing in Rs. 36,660 crore in commitments and creating 56,766 new job opportunities for the people of Madurai, the adjoining southern districts and ofcourse #JobsForTN !\\n\\n#CMMKStalin is transforming Madurai from a historic temple town to an economic powerhouse, from a heritage & culture hotspot to being an industry and R&D hotspot !", "The Honourable Chief Minister also laid the foundation stone for the new SIPCOT Industrial Park in Melur. This single act opens the doors for years of growth for Madurai and its neighbouring districts.", "Investments across Madurai, Thoothukudi, Sivagangai and Theni reflect a future-ready economy. From sustainable aviation fuel to solar manufacturing, from a flight training academy to a modern non-leather footwear cluster, from an electronics ecosystem in Theni to IT and digital services jobs spread across Madurai. Every corner of this region will now have a growth story to be proud of !", "The most exciting announcement was that of HD Hyundai, one of the world\\u2019s largest shipbuilders, which will move forward with a major shipyard in Thoothukudi. A global giant choosing Tamil Nadu for a project of this scale shows the trust that industry now places in our talent and governance.", "Ship repair, offshore engineering, ship rig services, and new shipbuilding capacity through partners like Chowgle will give Coastal Tamil Nadu a maritime identity that matches global standards. You will soon see ships built in Tamil Nadu sailing across the world.\\n\\nToday we also launched the Toy Manufacturing Policy ! Expect massive jobs in this front soon !", "Madurai TN Rising is a turning point, especially at a moment when divisive forces are trying to curtail Madurai\\u2019s growth. The people of Madurai know very very well that its the #DravidianModel Govt of TN which will prevail and secure a bigger brighter future for the people of Maamadurai\\u2665\\ufe0f\\n\\n#InvestInTN #BullishOnTN", "\\u0bae\\u0bbe\\u0ba3\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bbf\\u0b95\\u0bc1 \\u0ba4\\u0bae\\u0bbf\\u0bb4\\u0bcd\\u0ba8\\u0bbe\\u0b9f\\u0bc1 \\u0bae\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0bb2\\u0bae\\u0bc8\\u0b9a\\u0bcd\\u0b9