Thiru. Om Birla, seeking the removal of Justice G.R. Swaminathan of the Madurai Bench of the Madras High Court, whose recent orders and actions have been viewed as disruptive to social harmony and detrimental to the integrity of the judiciary.\\n\\n#DMKinParliament", "During question hour in Lok Sabha today, I pointed out the problems that arise out of discrepancies between the Union government\\u2019s ST verification database and those maintained by the states. This anomaly prevents many individuals from accessing Union government schemes and employment. I sought clarity on how the government intends to resolve this and guarantee rightful access for every tribal citizen.\\n\\n#DMKinParliament", "Birthday greetings to Ms. Sonia Gandhi, a stalwart who has stood firm to defend and protect democratic ideals of our nation, and led with dignity, courage, and empathy through testing times. She continues to be a strong pillar of support for all democratic forces in India. \\n\\nWishing her good health and many more years of dedicated service to the nation.", "\\u201c\\u0b87\\u0bae\\u0bc8 \\u0b95\\u0bca\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bbe\\u0bae\\u0bb2\\u0bcd \\u0b87\\u0baf\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bc8 \\u0bb5\\u0bb3\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4 \\u0b8e\\u0ba9\\u0bcd \\u0b87\\u0bb3\\u0bc8\\u0baf \\u0ba4\\u0bae\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bbf\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bbf\\u0bb2\\u0bcd \\u0ba4\\u0b99\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bae\\u0bbe\\u0b95 \\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0bb3\\u0b99\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bbf\\u0baf\\u0bb5\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u201d \\u0b8e\\u0ba9 \\u0bae\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bae\\u0bbf\\u0bb4\\u0bb1\\u0bbf\\u0b9e\\u0bb0\\u0bcd \\u0b9f\\u0bbe\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bb0\\u0bcd \\u0b95\\u0bb2\\u0bc8\\u0b9e\\u0bb0\\u0bcd \\u0b85\\u0bb5\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bbe\\u0bb2\\u0bcd \\u0baa\\u0bcb\\u0bb1\\u0bcd\\u0bb1\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0b9f\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0b85\\u0bb3\\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0bb1\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1 \\u0b95\\u0bb4\\u0b95\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0ba9\\u0b