2026-01-28 17:41:12,100 [DEBUG] voyage - data='{"input": ["#TamilNadu on TOP, \\nwith a LONG lead, \\nyet again \\u2665\\ufe0f\\ud83c\\udf04\\n\\nThe latest \\u201cHandbook of Statistics on Indian States 2024\\u201325\\u201d released by the Reserve Bank of India says that our Gross State Domestic Product at current prices has grown from Rs. 26.89 lakh crore in 2023\\u201324 to Rs. 31.19 lakh crore in 2024\\u201325. \\n\\nThat is a MASSIVE 16% \\ud83c\\udf1fnominal growth !!!\\n\\nThe highest\\ud83d\\udcc8 among large states in India !!! \\n\\nPer capita income has also risen sharply as well \\u2728", "What a stupendous performance but the most professionally run state in India, led by our Honourable Chief Minister Tamil Nadu Thiru. MK Stalin avargal ! \\n\\nLet me remind you, this growth is happening in parallel with some of the largest #WelfareSchemes the state has ever rolled out. \\n\\nYou call them \\u201cfreebies\\u201d, we said those are economic enablers ! NOW THIS IS PROOF.", "This astounding growth reflects sustained investor confidence, strong inclusive governance and the daily effort of millions of hard working people across this amazing state.\\n\\nTamil Nadu has consistently ranked among the top large states on per capital income, and this continued rise shows that growth is translating into higher incomes and wider opportunity across regions, not just in a few pockets.\\n\\nTHIS IS #DistributedGrowth at its BEST !", "THIS IS #DistributedGrowth at its BEST ! \\n\\nThe Dravidian Model focuses on building the economy while expanding access, dignity, and opportunity. Industrial growth, social justice, skilling, and regional balance move together, NOT in isolation !\\n\\nWhat you are seeing in these numbers is a development path that is:\\n\\nstable, \\ninclusive, \\nand future-ready \\u2728", "stable, \\ninclusive, \\nand future-ready \\u2728\\n\\nThis is the result of only the foundation that we have laid over the past 4 years and the next 5 years under #DM2point0 is gonna be at a more massively different league thanks to this strong and robust foundation !\\n\\n#InvestInTN #BullishOnTN #JobsForTN", "Raised critical issues to the Minister of Chemicals and Fertilizers on the quality of medicines supplied through Jan Aushadhi Kendras:\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udc8a Is the Union Government aware of the growing crisis in quality and availability of generic medicines at JAKs? What complaints and supply gaps have been officially recorded?\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udcc5 How many cases in the last five years involve quality failures, contaminants or substandard formulations at PMBJP outlets?", "\\ud83e\\uddea What strict quality-control measures are in place \\u2014 batch testing, surprise inspections, blacklisting, and timely recalls of substandard drugs?\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udd0e How is regulatory oversight being strengthened in procurement, vendor selection and stocking to ensure transparency?\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udcdd Is an independent audit mechanism being established to prevent further lapses?\\n\\nAffordable healthcare must never compromise on safety or quality. #JanAushadhi #DrugSafety #PublicHealth", "mkstalin udhay_stalin arivalayam dmkyouthwing DMKITwing dmksdwing DMK_Chennai", "Raised serious concerns to MoHUA_India on regional disparities in metro rail approvals:\\n\\n\\ud83d\\ude87 Have #metro DPRs from southern States \\u2014 including #Coimbatore & #Madurai \\u2014 been rejected using the 2017 Metro Rail Policy & outdated population thresholds? If so, why were similar projects approved in Agra, Bhopal, Indore, Nagpur with comparable or even lower populations?\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udcca What comparative criteria were applied, and why do approval standards vary so widely across regions?", "\\ud83d\\udcc9 Is the Union Government still relying on 2011 Census data to determine eligibility? Why are current demographic realities of fast-growing southern cities ignored?\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udd0d Were ridership projections from Tamil Nadu and other southern States rejected without independent or third-party evaluation?\\n\\n\\ud83d\\uded1 Why were 50:50 equity-sharing proposals declined for southern metros when similar models were approved elsewhere?", "\\ud83d\\ude8c Were phased metro options, light-metro alternatives or hybrid BRT-metro models even evaluated before rejection?\\n\\n\\u23f3 Will the Union Government reconsider these DPRs \\u2014 especially given the \\u201cdeep public resentment\\u201d in Coimbatore and Madurai \\u2014 and set a clear, time-bound review process?\\n\\nEquitable urban mobility requires uniform, transparent, data-driven decisions. \\n#MetroRail #TamilNadu #UrbanTransport\\n\\nmkstalin udhay_stalin arivalayam dmkyouthwing DMKITwing dmksdwing DMKChennai", "\\u0b87\\u0ba9\\u0bcd\\u0bb1\\u0bc1 \\u0baa\\u0bbf\\u0bb1\\u0ba8\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0ba8\\u0bbe\\u0bb3\\u0bcd \\u0b95\\u0bbe\\u0ba3\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0b9a\\u0bc2\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bb0\\u0bcd \\u0bb8\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bbe\\u0bb0\\u0bcd \\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0bc1 rajinikanth \\u0b85\\u0bb5\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1 \\u0b87\\u0ba9\\u0bbf\\u0baf \\u0ba8\\u0bb2\\u0bcd\\u0bb5\\u0bbe\\u0bb4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bcd!", "\\u0b87\\u0ba3\\u0bc8\\u0ba8\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bcb\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\ud83e\\udd1d", "Gen Z \\u0ba4\\u0bb2\\u0bc8\\u0bae\\u0bc1\\u0bb1\\u0bc8\\u0baf\\u0bbf\\u0ba9\\u0bb0\\u0bc8\\u0baf\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0ba4\\u0ba9\\u0ba4\\u0bc1 \\u0ba8\\u0b9f\\u0bbf\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bbe\\u0bb2\\u0bcd \\u0b95\\u0bb5\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0ba8\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bc1, \\u0baa\\u0bca\\u0ba9\\u0bcd\\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0bb4\\u0bbe \\u0b95\\u0bbe\\u0ba3\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0b9a\\u0bc2\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0bb8\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bbe\\u0bb0\\u0bcd rajinikanth \\u0b9a\\u0bbe\\u0bb0\\u0bcd \\u0b85\\u0bb5\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1 \\u0b87\\u0ba9\\u0bbf\\u0baf \\u0baa\\u0bbf\\u0bb1\\u0ba8\\u0bcd