2026-01-28 17:41:34,553 [DEBUG] voyage - data='{"input": ["This evening in Bengaluru, it was a privilege to be part of the celebrations of the 60th year of Rashtrotthana Parishat; commemorating 100 years of selfless Seva by the Rashtriya Swayamsevak Sangh in the forum of \\u2018Rashtrotsava 2025-26\\u2019 of Rashtrotthana Vidya Kendra, Banashankari, among the school children and their parents.", "Grateful to have shared the dais with Shri N. Dinesh Hegde avaru, General Secretary of Rashtrotthana Parishat; Shri Vasant Kumar avaru, Correspondent, RVK \\u2013 South Cluster; and Smt. Nanda avaru, Principal, RVK.\\n\\nInteracting with these bright young minds and their proud parents added to the joy of the evening, reaffirming the role of such institutions in nurturing values, character, and a strong sense of national responsibility alongside academic achievement.", "Every complaint matters. Every voice counts.\\nAs an MLA, I explain how citizens\\u2019 concerns move from conversations to concrete government action and why public participation is essential.\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udde3\\ufe0f Citizen complaints\\n\\ud83c\\udfdb\\ufe0f Administrative process\\n\\ud83c\\udf31 Real change at the ground level\\n\\n#PeopleFirst #MLA #GovernanceMatters #PublicGrievance #TamilNaduPolitics #Coimbatore #DemocracyInAction", "\\u0bae\\u0bbe\\u0ba3\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bbf\\u0b95\\u0bc1 \\u0baa\\u0bbe\\u0bb0\\u0ba4\\u0baa\\u0bcd \\u0baa\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0ba4\\u0bae\\u0bb0\\u0bcd \\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0bc1. narendramodi \\u0b9c\\u0bbf \\u0b85\\u0bb5\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bbf\\u0ba9\\u0bcd \\u0bb5\\u0bb4\\u0bbf\\u0b95\\u0bbe\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0bb2\\u0bbf\\u0ba9\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0b9f\\u0bbf, \\u0ba8\\u0bbe\\u0b9f\\u0bc1 \\u0bae\\u0bc1\\u0bb4\\u0bc1\\u0bb5\\u0ba4\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0ba8\\u0b9f\\u0bc8\\u0baa\\u0bc6\\u0bb1\\u0bcd\\u0bb1\\u0bc1 \\u0bb5\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bbf\\u0ba9\\u0bcd\\u0bb1 #SansadKhelMahotsav2025 \\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0bb3\\u0bc8\\u0